# VDT runtime stack (generic)

- Runtime / API / tools: **Rust** in `src/`, `tests/`, `benches/`, `src/bin/`. No Python product files (`git ls-files '*.py'` empty). No Java. Product tests/benches/scripts are `.rs` (`cargo xtask`, not `.sh` / `.ps1` / JSON harnesses).
- UI: thin HTML/CSS/JS glue only. Do not port large legacy JS (GSV: never copy `docs/vision/vision.js`).
- Ratio gate is **per product** (`docs/gsv/PRODUCTS.md`): GSV 95–100% (`gsv-loc-audit --stretch-96`); PoolAI 90–95%.
- Shell: MSYS2 bash. Do not run two `cargo` processes on the same `target/`.
